                Notice · key_clash                                                ✕

                Two actions share the key Ctrl+F: `search` and `search_results` act
                in a context they share, so both entries reverted to their
                defaults. Rebind one of them with /keys. An entry equal to the
                defaults counts as unset.

                Esc closes

